# CODEOWNERS Template (Reusable)

Copy to `.github/CODEOWNERS` in projects and adjust paths/owners.

```plaintext
# Global owners
* @team-leads

# Core modules
/core/ @core-team
/shared/ @core-team

# Feature modules
/feature/ @feature-teams

# App module
/app/ @app-team

# Build configuration
/build.gradle.kts @build-team
/settings.gradle.kts @build-team
/gradle/ @build-team
/libs.versions.toml @build-team
/gradle.properties @build-team

# CI/CD
/.github/ @devops-team

# Documentation
/docs/ @docs-team
*.md @docs-team
```

Notes:
- Order matters - last matching pattern takes precedence
- Use teams or individual usernames
- Keep in sync with actual module structure
